WEBVTT

00:02.252 --> 00:03.378
&gt;&gt; Are you ready, kids?
>> 孩子们，准备好了吗？

00:03.461 --> 00:05.296
All: Aye, aye, Captain!
全体：是啊是啊，队长！

00:05.380 --> 00:06.965
&gt;&gt; ♪ I can't hear you ♪
>> ♪ 我听不到你说话 ♪

00:07.048 --> 00:09.551
All: Aye, aye, Captain!
全体：是啊是啊，队长！

00:09.634 --> 00:11.970
&gt;&gt; ♪ Ohh... ♪
>> ♪ 哦... ♪

00:12.053 --> 00:13.638
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.722 --> 00:15.849
All: SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：海绵宝宝！

00:15.932 --> 00:17.684
&gt;&gt; ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he! ♪
>> ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的！ ♪

00:17.767 --> 00:19.894
All: SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：海绵宝宝！

00:19.978 --> 00:21.688
&gt;&gt; ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
>> ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:21.771 --> 00:23.982
All: SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：海绵宝宝！

00:24.065 --> 00:25.942
&gt;&gt; ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish! ♪
>> ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通！ ♪

00:26.025 --> 00:27.652
All: SpongeBob SquarePants!
&gt;&gt; Ready?
全部：海绵宝宝！
>> 准备好了吗？

00:27.736 --> 00:29.654
All: SpongeBob square pants!
全部：海绵宝宝方裤！

00:29.738 --> 00:31.573
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:31.656 --> 00:33.742
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:33.825 --> 00:35.368
&gt;&gt; SpongeBob
>> 海绵宝宝

00:35.452 --> 00:37.203
SquarePants!
方裤！

