00:57.682 --> 01:00.977
&gt;&gt;
Patrick!
>>
帕特里克！

01:02.979 --> 01:05.064
What are you doing out here,
silly?
你在这儿做什么
傻吗？

01:05.148 --> 01:09.068
&gt;&gt; I'm waiting for you
so we can play the day away!
>> 我在等你
这样我们就可以玩一天了！

01:09.152 --> 01:10.862
Aw, barnacles.
噢，藤壶。

01:10.945 --> 01:12.906
You're wearing
that dumb hat again.
你穿着
又是那顶蠢帽子。

01:12.989 --> 01:14.574
Every time you wear
that stupid thing,
每次穿的时候
那个愚蠢的事情，

01:14.657 --> 01:16.701
you're gone for the whole day.
你一整天都不见了。

01:16.785 --> 01:18.828
&gt;&gt; That's because this is
my work hat, Patrick.
>> 那是因为这是
我的工作帽，帕特里克。

01:18.912 --> 01:20.830
I have to wear it
when I go to work.
我必须穿上它
当我去上班的时候。

01:20.914 --> 01:22.832
&gt;&gt; Why don't you just
take it off
>> 你为什么不直接
把它脱下来

01:22.916 --> 01:25.084
so you don't have to go
to work today?
所以你不必去
今天上班吗？

01:25.168 --> 01:27.754
&gt;&gt;   I'm afraid
it doesn't work that way, buddy.
>> 我害怕
那样不行，伙计。

01:27.837 --> 01:31.007
&gt;&gt; I hate that hat.
>> 我讨厌那顶帽子。

01:31.090 --> 01:32.675
&gt;&gt; Bob!
>> 鲍勃！

01:32.759 --> 01:35.553
&gt;&gt; Fine!
Have it your way, hat!
>> 好吧！
随你的便吧，帽子！

01:35.637 --> 01:38.431
Looks like Squidward
has time to play.
长得像章鱼哥
有时间玩。

01:38.515 --> 01:40.433
Hey, Squidward!
&gt;&gt; What?
嘿，章鱼哥！
>> 什么？

01:40.517 --> 01:42.811
&gt;&gt; Oh, no!
He's got the hat too!
>> 哦，不！
他也有帽子！

01:42.894 --> 01:44.521
&gt;&gt; Don't worry, Patrick.
>> 别担心，帕特里克。

01:44.604 --> 01:45.939
I'll be back from work at 6:00.
我将于 6:00 下班回来。

01:46.022 --> 01:47.106
We can play then.
那我们就可以玩了。

01:47.190 --> 01:48.483
&gt;&gt; Oh.
>>哦。

01:48.566 --> 01:51.611
I'll show you, SpongeBob.
我会告诉你，海绵宝宝。

01:51.694 --> 01:54.197
I'll get a job...
And a hat.
我会找到一份工作...
还有一顶帽子。

01:57.534 --> 01:59.536
&gt;&gt; Whoa, whoa.
That's enough, lad.
>> 哇哦，哇哦。
够了，小伙子。

01:59.619 --> 02:01.371
What do you think,
I'm made of ketchup?
你觉得怎么样，
我是番茄酱做的？

02:01.454 --> 02:02.956
Now run along, boy.
现在就跑吧，孩子。

02:03.039 --> 02:04.290
Clank!
铮铮！

02:04.374 --> 02:05.750
Eh? That sounds like
呃？听起来像

02:05.834 --> 02:07.669
a band of roving tourists.
一群流动的游客

02:10.129 --> 02:11.798
Wait! Come back!
等待！回来！

02:11.881 --> 02:15.301
Don't you want to give me
your money?
你不想给我吗
你的钱？

02:15.385 --> 02:17.762
Oh, they're a slippery bunch.
哦，他们是一群狡猾的人。

02:17.846 --> 02:19.472
What do I got to do
to catch 'em?
我该怎么办
抓住他们？

02:19.556 --> 02:21.641
Stand around out here all day?
整天站在这里？

02:21.724 --> 02:23.560
What are you doing there,
Patrick?
你在那里做什么，
帕特里克？

02:23.643 --> 02:25.353
&gt;&gt; Standing around out here
all day.
>> 站在这里
一整天。

02:25.436 --> 02:28.481
Ding!
叮！

02:28.565 --> 02:31.401
&gt;&gt; How would you like a job,
Patrick?
>> 你想要一份怎样的工作，
帕特里克？

02:31.484 --> 02:33.152
&gt;&gt; Oh, boy!
Give me my hat!
>> 噢，孩子！
把我的帽子给我！

02:33.236 --> 02:35.196
&gt;&gt; You'll get your hat,
but first
>> 你会得到你的帽子，
但首先

02:35.280 --> 02:37.323
you have to entice people
into the restaurant
你必须吸引人们
进入餐厅

02:37.407 --> 02:40.743
by standing right here
and holding this sign.
站在这里
并举着这个牌子。

02:40.827 --> 02:42.912
That's not too tough for you,
is it, boy?
这对你来说并不太难
是吗，孩子？

02:42.996 --> 02:44.664
&gt;&gt; Sounds complicated,
>> 听起来很复杂，

02:44.747 --> 02:47.167
but if it gets me a work hat...
但如果它能给我一顶工作帽...

02:47.250 --> 02:48.626
How's this?
这怎么样？

02:48.710 --> 02:50.712
&gt;&gt; Perfect.
>> 完美。

02:50.795 --> 02:52.380
You'll be wearing that hat
in no time at all.
你会戴上那顶帽子
很快。

02:52.463 --> 02:53.882
&gt;&gt; Oh, boy.
>> 噢，孩子。

02:53.965 --> 02:56.175
&gt;&gt; What's shaking, Mr. K?
>> K 先生，什么在震动？

02:56.259 --> 02:58.177
&gt;&gt; Your buddy Patrick.
>> 你的朋友帕特里克。

02:58.261 --> 03:00.305
I hired him to stand out there
and hold that sign.
我雇用他是为了脱颖而出
并举着那个牌子。

03:00.388 --> 03:02.348
&gt;&gt; Oh, he is good.
>>哦，他很好。

03:02.432 --> 03:05.852
&gt;&gt; And look, he's about
to reel in his first customer.
>> 看，他即将
吸引他的第一个顾客。

03:05.935 --> 03:07.854
&gt;&gt; Can you direct me
to the Krusty Krab, please?
>> 你能指导我吗
请去蟹堡王吗？

03:07.937 --> 03:08.938
&gt;&gt; Uh...
>> 呃...

03:12.775 --> 03:14.569
&gt;&gt; What does he think
he's doing?
>> 他怎么想
他在做什么？

03:17.488 --> 03:19.824
They're walking right past him.
他们正从他身边走过。

03:19.908 --> 03:23.494
Patrick, you need to get
their attention, boy.
帕特里克，你需要得到
他们的注意力，男孩。

03:23.578 --> 03:25.455
&gt;&gt; Okay.
&gt;&gt; Ouch!
>> 好的。
>> 哎哟！

03:25.538 --> 03:27.957
&gt;&gt; That ain't the kind
of attention we need.
>> 不是这样的
我们需要的关注。

03:28.041 --> 03:30.126
Why don't you show a little
razzle-dazzle?
你为什么不表现一点
令人眼花缭乱？

03:30.209 --> 03:34.297
Maybe give the sign a little
twirl or something.
也许给一点标志
旋转什么的。

03:34.380 --> 03:37.216
I guess we'll keep working
on that one, eh, boy?
我想我们会继续工作
在那一个，呃，男孩？

03:37.300 --> 03:39.510
And listen,
if any tourists stroll by,
听着，
如果有游客走过，

03:39.594 --> 03:42.305
why don't you just blow 'em away
with a little extra twirl?
你为什么不把它们吹走
稍微额外旋转一下？

03:42.388 --> 03:43.765
&gt;&gt; Anything for my new hat.
>> 任何适合我新帽子的东西。

03:56.486 --> 03:58.905
&gt;&gt; That's enough, Patrick.
>> 够了，帕特里克。

03:58.988 --> 04:00.156
Ahh!
啊！

04:02.158 --> 04:03.576
&gt;&gt; I did it!
>> 我做到了！

04:03.660 --> 04:05.244
Did you see that, Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板，你看到了吗？

04:05.328 --> 04:06.621
&gt;&gt; I saw it.
>> 我看到了。

04:06.704 --> 04:08.623
&gt;&gt; Do I get my hat now?
>> 我现在可以拿到帽子了吗？

04:08.706 --> 04:10.083
&gt;&gt; What the heck?
It pays to advertise.
>> 到底是什么？
做广告是要付出代价的。

04:10.166 --> 04:11.167
&gt;&gt; My hat.
>> 我的帽子。

04:18.841 --> 04:21.469
&gt;&gt; Uh, what's wrong with him?
>> 呃，他怎么了？

04:21.552 --> 04:23.179
&gt;&gt; What's the matter, Patrick?
>> 出什么事了，帕特里克？

04:23.262 --> 04:25.139
&gt;&gt; I don't know.
>> 我不知道。

04:25.223 --> 04:29.185
Sometimes when I'm nervous,
I forget how to stand.
有时候当我紧张的时候，
我忘记了如何站立。

04:29.269 --> 04:30.812
&gt;&gt; He's nervous.
>> 他很紧张。

04:30.895 --> 04:33.147
&gt;&gt;
Look at that guy.
>>
看看那个家伙。

04:33.231 --> 04:35.233
He doesn't know how to stand
on his own two feet.
他不知道如何站立
靠自己的两只脚。

04:35.316 --> 04:37.485
&gt;&gt; Now, that's the kind
of mindlessness
>> 现在，就是这样的
无心的

04:37.568 --> 04:39.487
I'd pay money to see.
我愿意付钱去看。

04:39.570 --> 04:41.614
&gt;&gt; You mean cash money?
>> 你是说现金吗？

04:41.698 --> 04:42.907
&gt;&gt; Well, heck, yeah!
>> 好吧，哎呀，是啊！

04:42.991 --> 04:44.283
&gt;&gt; $5, please.
>> 请 5 美元。

04:44.367 --> 04:46.911
All right.
好的。

04:46.995 --> 04:48.746
There's that sound again.
又是那个声音。

04:50.289 --> 04:51.749
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

04:51.833 --> 04:53.293
&gt;&gt; They're loving it.
>> 他们很喜欢它。

04:53.376 --> 04:55.044
Patrick, you've captured
帕特里克，你抓住了

04:55.128 --> 04:56.963
the attention
of all these tourists
注意力
在所有这些游客中

04:57.046 --> 04:58.298
with your ridiculous
flapdoodle.
和你的可笑
胡言乱语。

04:58.381 --> 04:59.549
&gt;&gt; I did?
>> 我做到了？

04:59.632 --> 05:01.467
&gt;&gt; That's right.
>> 没错。

05:01.551 --> 05:03.052
I think we finally found
a job you're good at:
我想我们终于找到了
你擅长的工作：

05:03.136 --> 05:05.221
being an absolute buffoon.
是一个绝对的小丑。

05:05.304 --> 05:08.266
If it's folly you crave,
it can be found exclusively
如果你渴望的是愚蠢，
它可以独家找到

05:08.349 --> 05:09.809
at the Krusty Krab
在蟹堡王

05:09.892 --> 05:11.519
for just $5 a head.
每头仅需 5 美元。

05:14.313 --> 05:16.441
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

05:16.524 --> 05:17.942
&gt;&gt; It's official.
>> 这是官方的。

05:18.026 --> 05:21.279
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

05:21.362 --> 05:22.739
&gt;&gt; I hate everyone.
>> 我讨厌所有人。

05:26.576 --> 05:29.328
You imbeciles think
that's entertainment?
你们这些白痴以为
这就是娱乐？

05:29.412 --> 05:33.666
Well, brace yourselves
for some true entertainment.
嗯，做好准备
为了一些真正的娱乐。

05:33.750 --> 05:35.418
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:35.501 --> 05:37.003
&gt;&gt; Patrick?
>> 帕特里克？

05:37.086 --> 05:38.921
&gt;&gt; Yes?
&gt;&gt; Are you okay?
>> 是吗？
>> 你还好吗？

05:39.005 --> 05:40.673
&gt;&gt; I'm fine.
>> 我很好。

05:40.757 --> 05:44.719
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:44.802 --> 05:47.430
&gt;&gt; Oh, that horrible noise!
>> 哦，那可怕的噪音！

05:47.513 --> 05:49.557
Let's get out of here!
我们离开这里吧！

05:49.640 --> 05:52.351
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:52.435 --> 05:55.313
&gt;&gt; What the barnacles
is going on out here?
>> 藤壶是什么
这里发生什么事了吗？

05:55.396 --> 05:58.107
&gt;&gt; I'm entertaining
these heathens.
>> 我很有趣
这些异教徒。

05:58.191 --> 06:00.318
&gt;&gt; We've got all
the entertainment we need,
>> 我们已经拥有一切
我们需要的娱乐，

06:00.401 --> 06:02.195
thank you very much.
非常感谢。

06:02.278 --> 06:04.697
Where'd he go?
&gt;&gt; Come on, Patrick.
他去哪儿了？
>> 来吧，帕特里克。

06:04.781 --> 06:06.866
Easy, now.
Right this way.
容易，现在。
就这样。

06:06.949 --> 06:09.118
&gt;&gt; What in the name of Neptune
is going on here?
>> 以海王星的名义做什么
这是怎么回事？

06:09.202 --> 06:11.037
&gt;&gt; Patrick had a bloody nose,
so I was gonna walk him home.
>> 帕特里克鼻子流血，
所以我要送他回家。

06:11.120 --> 06:12.830
&gt;&gt; Oh, a bloody nose, Eh?
>> 哦，鼻子流血了，呃？

06:12.914 --> 06:14.957
You think I was born yesterday?
你以为我是昨天出生的？

06:15.041 --> 06:17.210
He doesn't even have a nose.
他甚至没有鼻子。

06:17.293 --> 06:19.212
Now get back to work,
the all of youse.
现在回去工作吧
你们所有人。

06:19.295 --> 06:21.881
I'm not running
a happy factory here.
我没有跑步
这里是一个快乐的工厂。

06:21.964 --> 06:24.717
Keep up the good work, Patrick.
继续努力，帕特里克。

06:24.801 --> 06:26.010
&gt;&gt; You got it, Mr. K.
>> 你明白了，K 先生。

06:33.101 --> 06:35.228
&gt;&gt; That guy still flopping?
>> 那家伙还在失败吗？

06:35.311 --> 06:37.063
&gt;&gt; Yeah, amazing, isn't he?
>> 是的，太棒了，不是吗？

06:37.146 --> 06:38.898
&gt;&gt; Doesn't that get old?
>> 这不会变老吗？

06:38.981 --> 06:40.650
&gt;&gt; Aw.
&gt;&gt; He's got a point.
>> 噢。
>> 他说得有道理。

06:40.733 --> 06:42.151
&gt;&gt; Yeah.
You seen enough?
>> 是的。
你看够了吗？

06:42.235 --> 06:44.612
&gt;&gt; Yeah, let's get out of here.
>> 是的，我们离开这里吧。

06:44.695 --> 06:46.489
&gt;&gt; Me too. I'm out.
>> 我也是。我出去了。

06:46.572 --> 06:48.366
&gt;&gt; What? Wait!
Don't go.
>> 什么？等待！
别走。

06:48.449 --> 06:50.326
Why are you leaving?
你为什么要离开？

06:50.409 --> 06:53.246
&gt;&gt; This guy's act is stale.
We crave excitement.
>> 这家伙的行为已经过时了。
我们渴望兴奋。

06:53.329 --> 06:55.248
All: Yeah, we crave excitement.
所有人：是的，我们渴望兴奋。

06:55.331 --> 06:57.625
&gt;&gt; Okay, okay,
you want excitement?
>> 好吧好吧，
你想要刺激吗？

06:57.708 --> 07:01.462
What if I...added a box?
Huh, huh?
如果我...添加一个盒子怎么办？
嗯，嗯？

07:01.546 --> 07:03.381
&gt;&gt; Sort of the same, really.
&gt;&gt; Yeah.
>> 确实有点一样。
>> 是的。

07:03.464 --> 07:05.675
&gt;&gt; Oh, okay.
>> 哦，好吧。

07:05.758 --> 07:12.849
So what if he flopped from
two boxes...into...a cream pie?
如果他从
两盒……放进……奶油派？

07:12.932 --> 07:14.267
&gt;&gt; I like pie.
>> 我喜欢馅饼。

07:14.350 --> 07:15.685
&gt;&gt; Say, now.
>> 说吧，现在。

07:15.768 --> 07:17.436
&gt;&gt; That I'd pay to see.
>> 我愿意付费观看。

07:17.520 --> 07:19.480
&gt;&gt; Thank you, thank you,
thank you.
>> 谢谢谢谢谢谢
谢谢。

07:19.564 --> 07:23.526
&gt;&gt; Okay, boy, let 'er rip!
>> 好吧，孩子，让我们撕裂吧！

07:23.609 --> 07:25.403
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

07:25.486 --> 07:27.446
&gt;&gt; I'll be in the back,
counting me money.
>> 我会在后面，
数我钱。

07:27.530 --> 07:29.282
If the crowd gets bored,
add some more boxes.
如果人群感到无聊，
添加更多的盒子。

07:29.365 --> 07:30.366
&gt;&gt; Whatever.
>> 无论如何。

07:32.952 --> 07:34.996
&gt;&gt; Hey, hat man.
>> 嘿，戴帽子的人。

07:35.079 --> 07:36.706
How you feeling
after your first day on the job?
你感觉如何
第一天上班后？

07:36.789 --> 07:39.208
&gt;&gt; I feel like a million bucks.
>> 我感觉自己像一百万美元。

07:39.292 --> 07:41.919
&gt;&gt; Patrick, Patrick,
are you all right?
>> Patrick, Patrick,
你还好吗？

07:42.003 --> 07:43.337
Say something.
说些什么。

07:43.421 --> 07:45.548
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

07:45.631 --> 07:47.675
&gt;&gt; Okay, that's it.
>> 好的，就是这样。

07:47.758 --> 07:50.261
No best friend of mine is gonna
suffer permanent brain trauma
我最好的朋友都不会
遭受永久性脑外伤

07:50.344 --> 07:52.889
just so Mr. Krabs can make
a quick buck.
这样蟹老板就能做到
赚快钱。

07:52.972 --> 07:54.640
I'm gonna go have a talk
with him right--
我要去谈谈
和他在一起——

07:54.724 --> 07:56.142
&gt;&gt; No!
>> 不！

07:56.225 --> 07:57.810
Please, don't tell Mr. Krabs!
请不要告诉蟹老板！

07:57.894 --> 07:59.896
You don't understand,
你不明白，

07:59.979 --> 08:03.691
for years people have been
telling me, "you're no good."
多年来人们一直
告诉我：“你不好。”

08:03.774 --> 08:05.067
Now I'm good!
现在我好了！

08:05.151 --> 08:07.612
I have a hat to prove it!
我有一顶帽子可以证明这一点！

08:07.695 --> 08:10.990
