>> 但他们会来
并把我们赶出去。

16:48.590 --> 16:50.926
&gt;&gt; Not if we hide.
>> 如果我们躲起来就不会。

16:51.009 --> 16:52.344
&gt;&gt; Hide?
>> 隐藏？

16:52.428 --> 16:54.680
Isn't that kind of sneaky?
这不是很狡猾吗？

16:54.763 --> 16:57.808
&gt;&gt; Oh, it's sneaky, all right,
>>哦，这很狡猾，好吧，

16:57.891 --> 17:00.436
really sneaky.
真是鬼鬼祟祟的。

17:00.519 --> 17:02.312
Come on.
快点。

17:02.396 --> 17:04.440
Haven't you always wanted
to have a toy store
你不是一直想要
开一家玩具店

17:04.523 --> 17:05.983
all to yourself?
全部给你自己？

17:06.066 --> 17:07.860
&gt;&gt; No.
>> 没有。

17:09.945 --> 17:11.905
What'll we do first?
我们先做什么？

17:11.989 --> 17:14.783
&gt;&gt; We need to find a hiding spot
where they'll never find us.
>> 我们需要找到一个藏身之处
他们永远找不到我们的地方。

17:14.867 --> 17:17.327
And I know just the place.
我只知道那个地方。

17:22.166 --> 17:26.086
&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt; Come on, boy, let's go.
>>
>> 来吧，孩子，我们走吧。

17:28.505 --> 17:31.675
The store's empty, so go ahead
and lock 'er up, Frank.
商店里空无一人，所以继续吧
把它锁起来，弗兰克。

17:31.759 --> 17:33.302
&gt;&gt; My name is Steve.
>> 我叫史蒂夫。

17:33.385 --> 17:34.595
&gt;&gt; Whatever
floats your boat, Frank.
>> 随便
弗兰克，让你的船浮起来。

17:43.812 --> 17:46.273
&gt;&gt; The coast is clear.
>> 海岸清澈。

17:46.356 --> 17:48.734
Push, SpongeBob, push.
推，海绵宝宝，推。

17:53.989 --> 17:56.325
Push, man, push!
推，伙计，推！

18:02.080 --> 18:04.833
Okay, SpongeBob.
Give me your hand.
好吧，海绵宝宝。
把你的手给我。

18:04.917 --> 18:06.960
That's my boy.
那是我的男孩。

18:07.044 --> 18:08.545
Brace yourself.
振作起来。

18:12.841 --> 18:14.760
&gt;&gt; Thanks, pal.
>> 谢谢，朋友。

18:14.843 --> 18:15.928
Well, we did it.
好吧，我们做到了。

18:16.011 --> 18:18.597
Yay!
耶！

18:18.680 --> 18:19.973
&gt;&gt; Yay!
>> 耶！

18:20.057 --> 18:21.683
Oh, this is so awesome!
哦，这太棒了！

18:21.767 --> 18:23.018
&gt;&gt; Nothing can ruin it.
>> 没有什么可以毁掉它。

18:33.904 --> 18:35.864
&gt;&gt; Patrick, is that you?
>> 帕特里克，是你吗？

18:35.948 --> 18:37.241
&gt;&gt; What?
&gt;&gt; I said, is that you?
>> 什么？
>> 我说，是你吗？

18:37.324 --> 18:38.784
&gt;&gt; I can't hear you.
>> 我听不到你说话。

18:38.867 --> 18:40.661
It's too dark in here.
这里太黑了。

18:40.744 --> 18:42.955
Don't worry.
I'll just use my night vision.
不用担心。
我就用我的夜视仪吧。

18:43.038 --> 18:46.333
&gt;&gt; You have night vision?
>> 你有夜视能力吗？

18:46.416 --> 18:49.127
&gt;&gt; Yeah.
>> 是的。

18:49.211 --> 18:51.296
&gt;&gt; How long have you had that?
>> 你这样有多久了？

18:51.380 --> 18:53.382
&gt;&gt; Remember that flashlight
I stuck in my ear?
>> 记住手电筒
我卡在耳朵里了？

18:53.465 --> 18:55.050
&gt;&gt; Oh, yeah.
&gt;&gt; Well, I guess it worked
>> 哦，是的。
>> 好吧，我想它有效了

18:55.134 --> 18:56.718
its way into my brain.
它进入我的大脑。

19:03.058 --> 19:04.810
Shoot,
the batteries are dead.
拍摄，
电池没电了。

19:04.893 --> 19:09.815
It's dark, scary.
天很黑，很可怕。

19:09.898 --> 19:11.567
&gt;&gt; Calm down, buddy.
>> 冷静点，伙计。

19:11.650 --> 19:13.569
We just need to find
the light switch.
我们只需要找到
电灯开关。

19:13.652 --> 19:15.153
But you have
to let me down first.
但你有
首先让我失望。

19:15.237 --> 19:17.364
&gt;&gt; Yeah, right, SpongeBob.
>> 是的，没错，海绵宝宝。

19:17.447 --> 19:21.910
I let you down.
We find the light switch.
我让你失望了。
我们找到电灯开关。

19:21.994 --> 19:26.915
And everything turns out peachy.
一切都变得美好。

19:26.999 --> 19:28.458
&gt;&gt; Yes.
>> 是的。

19:28.542 --> 19:30.711
&gt;&gt; Look around you, SpongeBob!
>> 看看你的周围，海绵宝宝！

19:30.794 --> 19:31.962
We're surrounded.
我们被包围了。

19:32.045 --> 19:33.839
&gt;&gt; By toys?
>> 通过玩具？

19:33.922 --> 19:37.259
&gt;&gt; That want to get us.
>> 想要得到我们。

19:42.890 --> 19:44.808
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

19:51.648 --> 19:52.649
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

20:01.366 --> 20:03.535
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

20:18.967 --> 20:21.970
&gt;&gt; Are we gonna hide in here
for the rest of our lives?
>> 我们要躲在这里吗
我们的余生？

20:22.054 --> 20:23.889
&gt;&gt; No.
>> 没有。

20:23.972 --> 20:25.807
&gt;&gt; Are we going
to the ladies' room again?
>> 我们去吗
又去女厕所？

20:25.891 --> 20:27.225
&gt;&gt; No. We're going
to fight back.
>> 不，我们要去
反击。

20:27.309 --> 20:28.560
And we're going to win.
我们会赢。

20:45.661 --> 20:47.704
&gt;&gt; That was fun.
>> 那很有趣。

20:47.788 --> 20:51.166
Now let's dress up
like fairy princesses.
现在我们来装扮一下
就像童话里的公主一样。

21:03.261 --> 21:04.888
&gt;&gt; Ready, Patrick?
>> 准备好了吗，帕特里克？

21:04.972 --> 21:06.223
&gt;&gt; Let's get some!
>> 让我们来一些吧！

21:18.193 --> 21:20.696
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
